SY_TALK("_-uvJuq5QWw",[[2,["Today, long time back,"]],[8,["Christ was born."]],[14,["You all know the story of His birth."]],[17,["And"]],[21,["of all the sufferings He had to go through."]],[31,["He's the One who has"]],[35,["given us a model of a Sahaja Yoga,"]],[41,["for He didn't live for Himself,"]],[44,["in no way."]],[47,["But He lived for others,"]],[50,["working out the Agnya chakra."]],[56,["You may be divine,"]],[62,["you may be very powerful,"]],[67,["but this world is so cruel"]],[71,["that they don't understand spirituality."]],[77,["They don't understand the spiritual greatness."]],[83,["Not only that,"]],[85,["but there are many factors which attack spirituality."]],[90,["They have always done it."]],[94,["Every saint has suffered a lot."]],[98,["But I think Christ has suffered the most."]],[106,["As you know, He was endowed with all the powers of Shri Ganesh,"]],[112,["as He is the reincarnation of Shri Ganesha."]],[117,["The first of them was His innocence."]],[122,["He was the eternal child we should say."]],[126,["That He couldn't understand the cruelties and the hypocrisy"]],[133,["of this stupid world."]],[137,["Still, if you understand what can you do about it?"]],[144,["But with great courage He took birth"]],[149,["in the country where people had no idea of"]],[156,["spirituality."]],[160,["I have read a book about Him"]],[163,["saying that He came to Kashmir"]],[166,["where He met one of My forefathers - Shalivahana."]],[173,["It’s very interesting because it’s all in Sanskrit"]],[178,["and the writer perhaps did not know Sanskrit,"]],[181,["so he has given"]],[186,["everything in Sanskrit language,"]],[192,["which is not very congenial, I'm sure,"]],[197,["to the Western people."]],[201,["Thank God he didn't know Sanskrit,"]],[204,["otherwise it would have been very dangerous."]],[210,["It's written in that"]],[212,["that he asked Christ, “Why have You come to India?”"]],[218,["So He said, “This is My country,"]],[223,["that's why I've come here,"]],[226,["where people respect spirituality."]],[230,["But I live among people"]],[233,["who do not understand spirituality at all.”"]],[241,["His conversation"]],[246,["with him was very, very interesting."]],[250,["Because Shalivahana said"]],[252,["that “There is more reason that You should go back to Your country"]],[257,["and teach them Nirmala Tattwam.”"]],[262,["That's the principle of purification."]],[268,["Went back, after three and a half years,"]],[273,["He was crucified."]],[278,["I personally think the big difference"]],[282,["between the Western execution and Indian"]],[287,["is that it’s -"]],[292,["in the West,"]],[295,["killing is a very great profession."]],[302,["With the slightest pretext they kill people."]],[308,["Anybody who is a saint was killed"]],[313,["or they called him a madcap."]],[317,["It's the best way to avoid spirituality."]],[324,["While in India,"]],[327,["if a saint says anything,"]],[331,["then he is not challenged - never."]],[336,["But they believe in it."]],[339,["Because he is a saint, he is a much higher personality than we are."]],[345,["Though there were very nasty people around and they tortured them."]],[350,["But as a whole the public, the people, respected them."]],[361,["If there are false gurus, normally they don't stay in this country"]],[366,["because they know they'll be found out."]],[369,["Also they are so money-oriented that they go to America or"]],[374,["to some foreign countries and settle down there to make money."]],[383,["This is one of the signs one should see."]],[387,["This may be one of the reasons why"]],[390,["Christ was born in a very, very ordinary family."]],[396,["He had no proper bed to sleep as a child also."]],[404,["It's all described,"]],[410,["where He slept,"]],[413,["how His mother and father"]],[419,["lived in a place where"]],[424,["there were cows and calves."]],[431,["It was to show that"]],[435,["spirituality doesn't need any luxury,"]],[443,["doesn't need any pomp and show."]],[449,["It is a power within."]],[454,["It is a glow and the light within"]],[460,["which shows,"]],[465,["automatically."]],[467,["You don't have to do anything to show it off."]],[475,["Such a person doesn't have any sense of money"]],[483,["and other things as possessions."]],[492,["He was bothered about people who were suffering physically,"]],[497,["even the lepers,"]],[500,["and He tried to cure them,"]],[507,["He tried to help so many people who were sick physically,"]],[517,["because at that time,"]],[520,["there were no hospitals, no doctors."]],[525,["So His attention was drawn to people"]],[528,["who were suffering physically."]],[533,["Also mentally He tried to prepare them."]],[538,["There are so many beautiful sermons on the mount."]],[544,["In a way that time, people"]],[550,["were not so materialistic,"]],[553,["so they listened to Him -"]],[556,["you can't say how many understood Him."]],[561,["It's very important"]],[564,["that if you are not a realized soul,"]],[569,["then it’s difficult"]],[573,["to understand spirituality."]],[579,["The one who is talking about spirituality"]],[584,["and the one who is listening to it,"]],[587,["both of them have to have minimum of realization."]],[595,["So from His beautiful life that I've seen,"]],[601,["we have to learn"]],[604,["that unless and until we are realized soul,"]],[608,["we will be torturing the spirit of Christ."]],[617,["We have seen it’s happening, all those who talk of Christ."]],[622,["He has said it very clearly,"]],[626,["“You'll be calling Me, ‘Christ, Christ,’ I won't recognize you.”"]],[632,["Very clearly He has said it."]],[635,["I don't know why they didn't remove it from the Bible."]],[639,["It means those who will talk"]],[645,["and preach and dress up"]],[649,["to show off that they are spiritual in the name of Christ,"]],[655,["He will not recognize them."]],[660,["It’s as simple as that."]],[664,["And this time now when it's the Last Judgment,"]],[669,["He is going to judge the whole world on the basis"]],[674,["of spirituality, which means vibrations."]],[679,["His judgment has already started."]],[683,["I've seen it."]],[686,["You can see in so many countries"]],[690,["things are just disappearing."]],[695,["All their ego,"]],[699,["all their aggressiveness,"]],[705,["all their cruelties are being challenged."]],[712,["And those who did wrong in the war also"]],[718,["are taken to task."]],[722,["So in the history also,"]],[725,["those who have done wrong to any community,"]],[730,["to any people,"]],[733,["they all will be taken to task."]],[737,["They had no business to be aggressive on people"]],[743,["and to torture them."]],[746,["This is what is Shri Ganesha's principle"]],[751,["acting through Sahaja Yoga."]],[759,["Christ didn't say that,"]],[763,["but He did say,"]],[766,["“There will be Last Judgment.”"]],[770,["On one side He was very kind and compassionate,"]],[777,["on the other side He was really Shri Ganesha,"]],[782,["because"]],[786,["He took a hunter to hit the people"]],[788,["who were selling things in the temple."]],[796,["You cannot have business in the name of religion."]],[802,["What a big thing it is to understand."]],[807,["But the Christians didn't follow that, they did not."]],[813,["I don't know where have they gone."]],[816,["As we have Mahatma Gandhi"]],[821,["who talked of spirituality and nothing else,"]],[826,["adhyatma all the time."]],[830,["But his successors who came"]],[835,["put him somewhere with his spirituality"]],[839,["and started a new world, new ideas"]],[845,["and a new style of life."]],[849,["Those who are supposed to be His followers"]],[851,["are now wanting to have many pubs,"]],[858,["and also all kinds of things, can you imagine?"]],[863,["This Congress was started by Mahatma Gandhi,"]],[868,["and the Congress wallahs are doing all this."]],[872,["Where are they going to lead?"]],[876,["The beauty of this country is,"]],[878,["the treasure of this country is spirituality."]],[883,["Instead of taking to spirituality, where are they going?"]],[890,["They may not be Christians, but they respect Christ,"]],[895,["they respect Bible."]],[897,["I must tell you, is a fact, people don't know."]],[902,["They are not Christians means in the sense they are not baptized,"]],[908,["but they respect because they understand"]],[913,["that there was so much of spirituality about Christ."]],[919,["He was the personification of spirituality."]],[925,["That's the beauty of Indians:"]],[928,["if somebody is a Hindu or a Muslim, makes no difference."]],[933,["There were many Muslims who were saints and Sufis in India,"]],[938,["they are all respected by everyone whether they are Muslims or Hindus."]],[946,["So for Christ,"]],[949,["nobody has any objection at all."]],[953,["On the contrary, you saw yesterday how they were all happy about it"]],[958,["because they are realized souls."]],[961,["But even if they are not,"]],[964,["in this country Christ is very much respected."]],[969,["They can't understand, how can they scrutinize the life of Christ?"]],[974,["How can they judge Him?"]],[976,["And how can they make vulgar films about Him?"]],[980,["This they can't bear it,"]],[983,["because the respect that they have for spirituality"]],[989,["exists very much more than it exists outside."]],[995,["Because in the name of Christ people have done such a lot of wrong,"]],[1002,["such a lot of killing has been done."]],[1008,["All kinds of wrong things have been accepted."]],[1014,["With all this, one doesn't understand"]],[1020,["how they have judged Christ."]],[1023,["For example, what I know in England, I saw, I was shocked"]],[1030,["that if somebody dies, they drink."]],[1032,["If somebody is born, they drink."]],[1035,["Drinking is the only way they have relationships."]],[1042,["“How can you drink?”"]],[1044,["I asked them. They said, “Why? Christ created wine.”"]],[1048,["I said, \"When?\" \"In a wedding.\""]],[1050,["I said, \"In a wedding? That was not wine,"]],[1054,["that was just the juice of the"]],[1063,["grapes that they grew there.\""]],[1067,["We call it drakshas in our language."]],[1073,["How can that be wine?"]],[1076,["It has to be first fermented,"]],[1081,["it has to be rotten, how can that be?"]],[1086,["So this is biggest dharma - to drink."]],[1094,["But in India we know,"]],[1097,["though nobody has said anything against drinking,"]],[1102,["but we know drinking is a sinful thing."]],[1106,["You see it everyday,"]],[1109,["everybody knows that if you drink"]],[1112,["you become absolutely out of your mind."]],[1114,["There's nothing to be said"]],[1119,["on a religious platform, but everybody knows"]],[1125,["that what is drinking is."]],[1131,["Not that people abroad don't know, they also know."]],[1135,["But somehow it has become a fashion."]],[1139,["Even in our country it has now been introduced,"]],[1142,["I don't know how after Independence, people have started drinking."]],[1149,["Every party they drink,"]],[1153,["also in the name of Christ on Christmas day."]],[1159,["It's such a insult to His beautiful holy life."]],[1168,["So, when They came on this earth, perhaps all Their"]],[1175,["powers of holiness were destroyed."]],[1179,["The very good thing about Indians is that at least they respect,"]],[1186,["they respect a holy place."]],[1190,["That is something good about them."]],[1194,["And they know what is holiness is."]],[1199,["Now of course they are becoming very modern and Americanized."]],[1204,["But still, they know what is wrong,"]],[1210,["what should not be done."]],[1213,["With Sahaja Yoga now I am very happy to say"]],[1217,["that the foreign Sahaja Yogis also have become very beautiful."]],[1225,["I'm surprised,"]],[1228,["because in their culture there is no spirituality."]],[1233,["But I don't know how they left all that nonsense"]],[1237,["and have come out like lotuses, beautifully,"]],[1243,["with such beautiful fragrance of spirituality."]],[1249,["This is something - a miracle."]],[1253,["Everybody says, “Mother, we can't believe it,"]],[1257,["how could have happened ? How did You manage this?”"]],[1264,["I would say it's the blessing of Christ."]],[1270,["They saw how people are"]],[1275,["working out in the name of Christ in a very degraded manner,"]],[1281,["and they developed a kind of a awareness"]],[1287,["that definitely something wrong with this,"]],[1290,["this is not Christ."]],[1292,["This is not His holy life they are depicting."]],[1299,["It’s something else."]],[1301,["And that is how I think in the West"]],[1305,["there's a greater urge,"]],[1307,["greater ascending force."]],[1313,["Yesterday somebody came and told Me,"]],[1315,["“Mother, there is no collective meditation.”"]],[1318,["I was very happy to hear that."]],[1323,["What is most important is meditation in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1328,["no doubt about it."]],[1331,["But"]],[1332,["the foreigners do meditation much more than Indians do,very surprising."]],[1339,["And foreign men and women are very highly equipped"]],[1345,["I must say, as far as spirituality is concerned."]],[1350,["Especially Russians,"]],[1352,["I was surprised that in America,"]],[1357,["they told Me, “Mother, these Americans are not Sahaja Yogis.”"]],[1362,["I said, “Why?” “They don't have that respect for You,"]],[1367,["they don't meditate."]],[1370,["Those who do not meditate are not Sahaja Yogis.”"]],[1375,["I said. \"I agree.\""]],[1377,["And they make all of them, all the Americans to meditate."]],[1384,["I don't know why in these Eastern Bloc people,"]],[1389,["Bulgarians and Russians and all these Romanians,"]],[1396,["how they have taken to Sahaja Yoga so much."]],[1401,["Of course, they had the curse of communism on them."]],[1406,["Maybe that they felt that they have missed something in life,"]],[1413,["and they went deep down into themselves,"]],[1417,["and that is how they have achieved it."]],[1421,["But I have to tell Indians"]],[1423,["that they have to meditate."]],[1426,["Indians have one or two very bad qualities,"]],[1432,["and that is one of them is groupism."]],[1435,["For example, if they're Brahmins, they'll sit together;"]],[1439,["if they are Kayasthas, they'll sit together;"]],[1442,["if they are Bhaniyas, they'll sit together."]],[1446,["If that is not so, then by another name they'll group together."]],[1452,["This is the worst curse of My country,"]],[1457,["because once you start grouping together"]],[1461,["you can never see the good of others"]],[1463,["and you can never see the bad of yourself."]],[1468,["This grouping together can bring lot of problems in this country."]],[1476,["At the time of Christ"]],[1481,["they had very different type of people."]],[1488,["Either they were interested in spirituality,"]],[1491,["or they were not."]],[1494,["Now we have people here who are interested in spirituality,"]],[1500,["but still they - one leg is in the water."]],[1507,["Where the age old problems still exist."]],[1515,["And this is the ruin of our country."]],[1521,["We cannot combine together,"]],[1525,["we cannot be friends with each other."]],[1528,["Of course not in Sahaja Yoga, I must say,"]],[1532,["it has been solved very well."]],[1536,["But if you see even at the time of Christ,"]],[1541,["He had problems with His disciples."]],[1547,["Especially something happened with Peter."]],[1554,["And"]],[1557,["He is the one who says a Satan will meet you."]],[1561,["Because I think people"]],[1566,["fall into the group of satanic forces."]],[1571,["And He said that He removed the satanic"]],[1576,["devils"]],[1578,["from many people and put them in the pigs."]],[1582,["It's true."]],[1584,["There is a satanic force"]],[1587,["which is working very strongly."]],[1591,["The more we develop security of spirituality,"]],[1596,["the more they will develop."]],[1599,["The satanic force is in a different form in the West"]],[1604,["and a different form in the East."]],[1608,["But I would like to tell for them"]],[1612,["to be careful"]],[1617,["how to find out the satanic forces in the West."]],[1632,["You may not be affected by that"]],[1635,["because you are realized souls,"]],[1637,["but you’ll have to fight it."]],[1641,["You will have to fight it,"]],[1643,["for example racialism."]],[1648,["Racialism is still very powerful there, very, very powerful."]],[1657,["And you have to fight racialism"]],[1662,["through marrying people who belong to other races."]],[1666,["But still I find difficult"]],[1669,["to marry a black person to a white person -"]],[1674,["is an impossible situation."]],[1677,["If I try that I don't know what happens."]],[1681,["Once we had such a marriage, I must tell you."]],[1685,["And a white lady, French lady, was married to a black man."]],[1693,["Instead of the French lady dominating, this black man dominated."]],[1700,["So I was quite surprised, you know, how could that be?"]],[1705,["So, the reason was,"]],[1708,["I think he was taking the revenge maybe, the respite."]],[1713,["So first of all,"]],[1715,["tremendous love and affection has to grow"]],[1720,["between"]],[1724,["the people."]],[1727,["This color is so skin deep."]],[1732,["It has nothing to do with the love inside, nothing."]],[1738,["It's so skin deep."]],[1740,["Thank God in our country,"]],[1743,["you can have a wife"]],[1746,["who will be very dark, husband will be very fair"]],[1750,["or the vice-versa."]],[1754,["But they never look at that from that angle."]],[1757,["I don't think that exists in this country."]],[1763,["But we have another kind, you see,"]],[1766,["just is a typical human problem"]],[1772,["is that he discriminates. Through ego,"]],[1780,["which I must say,"]],[1782,["Christ has tried to fight your ego."]],[1789,["He was born in a very humble family"]],[1794,["and"]],[1797,["He was not a white-skinned man, no."]],[1802,["In your language He was brown,"]],[1805,["but in Indian language He was black."]],[1812,["But, when it comes to spirituality,"]],[1817,["you just see"]],[1821,["the enlightened one."]],[1825,["You don't see what color they have of the skin."]],[1832,["It's very, very superficial."]],[1836,["But this is one of the enemies of the Western life,"]],[1842,["I think, which must be conquered"]],[1846,["Materialism is another one."]],[1850,["But the worst of all which is against Christ"]],[1856,["is immorality."]],[1861,["Immorality is so much accepted in the West."]],[1866,["All kinds of immoral behavior is accepted."]],[1871,["Like, they say that"]],[1876,["all these immoral people say, vote for somebody,"]],[1880,["he becomes a president of America."]],[1883,["Then it’s all right, doesn't matter, all kinds of immorality is allowed."]],[1888,["But that is absolutely against Christ,"]],[1896,["absolutely."]],[1902,["People don't understand"]],[1905,["that immorality will lead them"]],[1911,["to a kingdom which I don't know what to call because"]],[1914,["it's even worse than animal kingdom."]],[1918,["And they are so immoral,"]],[1925,["they listen to people like Freud,"]],[1928,["as if they have no brains,"]],[1931,["they have no spirit,"]],[1935,["to take note of such a man."]],[1942,["Only after Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1947,["model of Christ's life you can have."]],[1952,["Whatever is past is over and finished."]],[1957,["Today now you are realized souls"]],[1960,["and morality is your strength."]],[1966,["Forget about the past,"]],[1969,["and I'm sure"]],[1972,["you can get many more people"]],[1975,["under the banner of Sahaja Yoga"]],[1980,["if you lead a very, very moral life."]],[1986,["At the same time,"]],[1989,["another very bad"]],[1995,["enemy we have is our anger."]],[2001,["So they are very proud, they will say,"]],[2004,["\"I'll now get angry."]],[2007,["You know, I'm very angry.\""]],[2009,["They are not ashamed about it"]],[2012,["and they go on saying that \"I'm very angry,\""]],[2017,["as if it's not wrong to say, \"I'm very angry.\""]],[2021,["Now they say, “I hate you.”"]],[2024,["I mean, imagine any Indian language, if they use this word"]],[2029,["it would be meaning “I'm committing sin.”"]],[2034,["So all this aggressiveness comes from anger."]],[2042,["If somebody has to be angry,"]],[2045,["he should be angry with himself."]],[2050,["Best is, to get rid of anger,"]],[2054,["you can pull your hair, you can bite yourself,"]],[2059,["you can use your pillow to hit yourself."]],[2067,["That may be the best way of taking out your anger."]],[2074,["But see for what are you angry?"]],[2077,["Sometimes it’s absolutely useless."]],[2080,["Sometimes it has no meaning."]],[2084,["Sometimes"]],[2086,["it's absolutely maddening, stupid."]],[2094,["But as long as you stop saying, \"I'm very angry,\""]],[2100,["that's it."]],[2103,["That's the time you should know you are falling down completely."]],[2110,["So Christ didn't talk of all the subtle things,"]],[2113,["I have been talking to you, because that was left to Me."]],[2117,["Without realization, how can you talk about subtler things?"]],[2122,["You cannot."]],[2127,["Last time I told you about the vibrations,"]],[2133,["what is it, what does it stand for"]],[2137,["and how you get the subtle energy which we call as tanmatra,"]],[2144,["of our light - tejas,"]],[2149,["of water - jala,"]],[2153,["and prithvi, agni."]],[2156,["But, I didn't tell you of one very special one"]],[2165,["which is, in English language you call  it ether."]],[2171,["But ether is the energy"]],[2173,["which is managed by another tanmatra, we call it akash."]],[2181,["It's specially today, because it's Christ"]],[2186,["who has sacrificed His life to open our Agnya Chakra,"]],[2192,["that we have reached that state of akash."]],[2197,["Without Him it would not have been possible."]],[2202,["We can have general communication."]],[2208,["Like we can talk to people, we can say things,"]],[2212,["we can also use our fingers to express ourselves,"]],[2217,["our hands to communicate."]],[2221,["But,"]],[2224,["to communicate vibrations,"]],[2230,["you have to have vibrations."]],[2233,["Otherwise you cannot feel another person."]],[2238,["But if you are at the Agnya level, means you are mental,"]],[2242,["absolutely mental,"]],[2245,["then your vibrations also are dwindling, in the sense"]],[2251,["you don't know what really they are saying."]],[2254,["You can't judge your vibrations, because these vibrations are mental."]],[2263,["They'll say, “Mother, we asked the vibrations.” I said, \"Really?\""]],[2268,["If you don't have any vibrations, how can you ask the vibrations?"]],[2273,["It's very common thing."]],[2275,["“We ask the vibration; we found from the vibrations.”"]],[2281,["It's not possible because you are just mental."]],[2287,["Now what Christ has done is to put you away from the mental level."]],[2294,["That is the most difficult. While I’m surprised,"]],[2298,["those who follow Christianity have the worst mental position."]],[2304,["They are mentally absolutely there,  like,"]],[2307,["I don't know what to call, like the fog of Delhi"]],[2313,["that you can't cross."]],[2318,["That’s what was broken was Christ."]],[2322,["How much we should be obliged to Him,"]],[2325,["that He removed the greatest hurdle in the human ascent,"]],[2333,["and that one was"]],[2336,["to break this Agnya,"]],[2339,["this mental being within us."]],[2347,["We read like mad,"]],[2350,["we listen to people like mad,"]],[2354,["we like those who give us feed for our mental being."]],[2361,["They're so mental, so argumentative,"]],[2366,["think no end of their intelligence,"]],[2368,["that you have to just say, “All right, namaskar.”"]],[2373,["You can't fight their mental attitude."]],[2379,["That's why Christ"]],[2383,["is to be worshipped"]],[2386,["by people who are so very mental."]],[2393,["And this mental nonsense has given"]],[2398,["such a sense of superiority to people."]],[2402,["“Oh, whatever we do, what's wrong? What's wrong?”"]],[2408,["They cannot correct themselves"]],[2411,["because unless and until you cross this limit of mental being,"]],[2417,["you cannot see yourself."]],[2423,["You cannot introspect . You cannot see yourself."]],[2427,["You'll see others, “These Sahaja Yogis are like this,"]],[2430,["Sahaja Yoga is like that,” all kinds of things."]],[2434,["But you can't see yourself,"]],[2437,["because the whole thing is mental."]],[2443,["This mental attitude should be completely curbed"]],[2451,["through the help of our Lord Jesus Christ."]],[2459,["But He's also mental,"]],[2462,["in your brains Christ is also mental, now what to do?"]],[2466,["The One who broke the mental attitude is also a mental -"]],[2471,["you have made Him into mental, like a statue"]],[2476,["of stone."]],[2482,["So, firstly we have to tell ourselves,"]],[2485,["“Now don't think, don't think, don't think, don't think.”"]],[2489,["Four times,"]],[2492,["and then you can rise above."]],[2497,["And this is very important."]],[2502,["In meditation you have to go beyond the mind."]],[2507,["And thanks to Christ that He’s sitting at the Agnya"]],[2513,["to finish off this nonsense of mental being."]],[2522,["I think people should stop reading also perhaps, maybe."]],[2527,["Even My lecture becomes mental, what to do?"]],[2530,["I mean everything goes into their head becomes mental, somehow."]],[2535,["And then they ask Me questions, “Mother, did You say it this way,"]],[2539,["what did You -” I said, “I said it to make you thoughtless."]],[2545,["Just to stun you,"]],[2548,["I didn’t say this to sit down and analyze and do, no, no."]],[2554,["I said this that you become absolutely shocked and stunned.”"]],[2565,["So the best thing for all of you is"]],[2570,["to become thoughtless."]],[2575,["That’s the blessing of Christ,"]],[2577,["that’s what He worked it out for you."]],[2582,["And I am sure,"]],[2585,["if you work it out that don’t pay attention to others."]],[2592,["Don’t react,"]],[2595,["just don’t react."]],[2597,["Everything they will see, they’ll react."]],[2601,["What is the need?"]],[2605,["What is the use?"]],[2608,["What are you going to do with that reaction?"]],[2616,["This reaction creates nothing but ripples of thoughts"]],[2621,["in your mind, I’ve told you hundreds of times."]],[2624,["And now you have to become"]],[2629,["absolutely thoughtless"]],[2633,["after this puja."]],[2636,["If that happens, I think we have achieved a lot."]],[2641,["That’s the biggest blessing that Christ has given you,"]],[2646,["which you should really enjoy."]],[2651,["Then only this Akash Tattwa in you will work."]],[2658,["And how it works?"]],[2662,["Through your attention,"]],[2665,["it works with Me as you know."]],[2668,["With My attention I work out many things."]],[2673,["How?"]],[2675,["Just My attention has become thoughtless,"]],[2680,["just thoughtless."]],[2683,["It goes wherever it goes, it works."]],[2687,["But if you put your attention for thought all the time"]],[2692,["for thinking,"]],[2695,["then it doesn’t do the work that it has supposed to do."]],[2702,["Attention works marvelously"]],[2707,["if you are thoughtless, otherwise it doesn’t."]],[2713,["So it has to rise from your own self."]],[2721,["Then from others"]],[2724,["to the higher level of humanity,"]],[2728,["where you are in communication with the sky,"]],[2732,["with, we can call it as the"]],[2736,["tanmatra, or the essential, or the essence"]],[2742,["of ether."]],[2746,["With ether you can have television, you can have telephone."]],[2750,["It's a miracle otherwise."]],[2752,["But with this tanmatra,"]],[2756,["sitting down here"]],[2758,["you can do the job."]],[2761,["It works,"]],[2764,["just attention works. I know that."]],[2768,["You also know very well."]],[2770,["You don't have to ask Me to put the attention,"]],[2773,["you just put the attention and it will work out."]],[2777,["It’s a very important thing that you have got."]],[2783,["I think that is the first thing -"]],[2786,["once you have,"]],[2789,["no problem."]],[2793,["But we start manifesting from the earth element."]],[2800,["Then from the agni element, then from the jala element,"]],[2805,["and then we come to tejas,"]],[2810,["where the face starts shining."]],[2815,["But lastly we get this thoughtless awareness"]],[2819,["by which our attention is absolutely free to do"]],[2826,["some special work."]],[2829,["But if you are all the time thinking,"]],[2832,["then poor this attention"]],[2836,["is so busy, you know, so very busy."]],[2840,["You don't have to ask Me then,"]],[2843,["\"Mother, please pay attention.\" You can pay attention,"]],[2846,["and you can work it out."]],[2853,["In this attention, you don't feel"]],[2860,["what you've got, what you are standing,"]],[2863,["what you are wearing, what others are doing - no, nothing."]],[2870,["You are one with yourself."]],[2875,["And it's a life full of humor."]],[2881,["So much humor."]],[2884,["So much of joy."]],[2886,["So much of happiness"]],[2890,["that you don't care for anything"]],[2893,["that normally people care for."]],[2900,["So,"]],[2902,["as it is now Sahaja Yoga has worked in so many countries."]],[2909,["I'm so very proud of you, very proud."]],[2913,["And now it is also going to African countries,"]],[2917,["is a very great satisfaction for Me."]],[2924,["And you all can do it;"]],[2927,["you all can work it out."]],[2930,["Only thing, become thoughtlessly aware,"]],[2935,["as the blessing of Christ."]],[2937,["If it works,"]],[2940,["you will be absolutely enjoying yourself."]],[2947,["So may God bless you."]],[2965,["The fact is that this English language has been imposed on us"]],[2972,["for the past three hundred years."]],[2976,["I have never studied the English language."]],[2979,["Never!"]],[2982,["Even in school there was a small book,"]],[2985,["and in the Medical College, no one taught English as a language."]],[2991,["My father used to say,"]],[2992,["“It is such an easy language and there are so few words in it,"]],[2997,["that there is no need to study it.”"]],[3000,["And he admitted us into a Marathi medium school."]],[3004,["And he used to advise us, \"Learn Marathi and Sanskrit language\"."]],[3010,["So I did not study Sanskrit language"]],[3015,["and as for Hindi, I never ever studied Hindi language."]],[3021,["No question about that!"]],[3024,["Didn't learn in school or in college"]],[3027,["Didn't learn hindi language anywhere!"]],[3031,["But there is one good quality in Me, which I must tell you about,"]],[3036,["that whenever I speak in Hindi, I can speak only in Hindi;"]],[3041,["and when I speak Marathi I can speak only in Marathi language,"]],[3044,["and when I speak in English, I can speak only English."]],[3048,["It is very difficult for Me to translate from one to the other."]],[3053,["That is why I cannot mix them up."]],[3057,["Each of these three languages is different from the others."]],[3061,["Now no one will believe"]],[3063,["that I have not studied Hindi language."]],[3068,["But because of My interest in reading,"]],[3071,["interest in reading good Hindi books,"]],[3076,["I learnt the Hindi language."]],[3080,["But in the beginning My Hindi speaking"]],[3082,["had a lot of words and influence from Sanskrit."]],[3088,["Because Maharastrians speak like that only."]],[3091,["They don't know day-to-day Hindi language."]],[3095,["When they speak Hindi"]],[3097,["more than half of the words will be Sanskrit"]],[3102,["and the rest will be Marathi."]],[3112,["You understand? This is the condition."]],[3116,["What I have understood from all this is,"]],[3124,["that even language comes as a gift of God."]],[3127,["Like you have a gift in music and arts,"]],[3131,["in the same way, aptitude for languages is also a blessing."]],[3134,["And by that, one can master many languages."]],[3140,["But the Hindi speaking people cannot learn any other language."]],[3147,["The reason for this is - for example the English people also,"]],[3151,["they cannot learn any other language."]],[3153,["And even if they learn it, they will not be fluent."]],[3157,["The reason is that everyone can speak English,"]],[3161,["so there is no interest for them in learning any other language."]],[3164,["Now the Hindi speaking people have this problem"]],[3170,["that they just cannot speak any other language."]],[3173,["I will never insist that you must learn Marathi,"]],[3176,["because Marathi language is very complicated."]],[3181,["It's very difficult."]],[3183,["Only Maharashtrians can understand it."]],[3186,["And it has so much merriment"]],[3190,["and so many jokes."]],[3192,["There is nothing indecent in that language."]],[3195,["There is not even a bit of filth or indecency in it."]],[3197,["It is such a profound and expressive language"]],[3204,["that for Sahaja Yoga there is no other language"]],[3207,["that is more appropriate than Marathi."]],[3209,["Because only in Marathi a description of  Kundalini was written."]],[3213,["Whatever has been written by saints and sages,"]],[3215,["has been written in Marathi language."]],[3219,["And if you learn Marathi, you can learn any other language."]],[3223,["There is no doubt in this."]],[3225,["But Maharashtrians will not learn any other language."]],[3230,["They are very obstinate."]],[3235,["I asked someone, “Just read this Hindi book”."]],[3240,["He read a little bit, and put it down."]],[3242,["I asked him: “Why?” and he said, “It is full of rubbish!"]],[3247,["Only nonsense is written, I don’t want to read it!”"]],[3250,["Because Marathi is such a clean language"]],[3253,["with such pure thoughts,"]],[3256,["that after reading... After reading Gita,"]],[3259,["you cannot read wayside books of dirt and filth."]],[3263,["You will not understand them!"]],[3267,["So if some of you start learning Marathi, it will be a good thing."]],[3272,["But it is a very difficult language to master"]],[3274,["There are a lot of synonyms in Marathi language."]],[3278,["The reason I am telling you this today"]],[3280,["is that even after coming to Maharashtra I have to speak in Hindi,"]],[3286,["because you do not understand Marathi."]],[3289,["In Pune I speak in Marathi only."]],[3293,["But in Mumbai I have to speak in Hindi."]],[3298,["So those who like to learn languages,"]],[3301,["should learn Marathi."]],[3305,["It is a language to learn."]],[3307,["And it is such a wonderful language"]],[3310,["that our Namdeva"]],[3315,["who was a saint, a very big, a very great saint,"]],[3322,["was called by Guru Nanak"]],[3328,["and told to learn Punjabi language"]],[3332,["and write his poetry in Punjabi."]],[3335,["And Namdevji wrote such a thick book, in Punjabi language."]],[3338,["I too was able to speak in Punjabi when I lived in Punjab."]],[3341,["If you can learn Marathi,"]],[3343,["then, except Tamil language, you can learn any other language."]],[3350,["Maybe you will be able to learn a few Tamil words"]],[3355,["It's such a  situation, that in this country"]],[3360,["there are fourteen official languages -"]],[3365,["we have, you will be surprised,"]],[3367,["fourteen official languages in this country."]],[3375,["So I will say this that if you learn Marathi,"]],[3380,["you will manage to learn at least 8-9 of these fourteen languages."]],[3391,["Now one more thing which is wonderful!"]],[3395,["The Bible has been translated,"]],[3400,["directly from Hebrew language"]],[3403,["directly in purity,"]],[3409,["in Marathi language."]],[3413,["In this area, there was a lady called Rama Devi,"]],[3416,["very intelligent and noble."]],[3418,["All the writings in the Bible,"]],[3423,["she made a translation of them - of all the Bible writings -"]],[3427,["and she did it in Marathi language."]],[3431,["In that she has used Marathi names,"]],[3435,["like for John she has used the name Yohan,"]],[3440,["and for Matthews she has used Matthai."]],[3443,["So the Bible that I have read was in Marathi,"]],[3448,["and that is why, many times there is confusion."]],[3451,["She has written everything very clearly and distinctly"]],[3455,["and she has written it in all its purity."]],[3459,["And she has written in it"]],[3462,["that when Christ went to a wedding"]],[3466,["He transformed water into the juice of grapes."]],[3474,["This is a fundamental point"]],[3477,["that she has written in Marathi."]],[3480,["The second amazing thing is that"]],[3486,["about the childhood of Christ"]],[3489,["and about boyhood of Christ"]],[3492,["I have not read any poem in English language."]],[3496,["I don’t know, have you ever heard"]],[3503,["a poetry piece"]],[3506,["about the description of Christ’s childhood?"]],[3513,["I have never heard one."]],[3516,["But in Marathi we have many."]],[3519,["Now, just yesterday they sang beautifully,"]],[3523,["\"Baala vadana tava baghuni Krista\"."]],[3528,["After seeing your small child's face -"]],[3530,["after seeing your face,"]],[3534,["your child like face - \"Baal Vadana\" -"]],[3539,["all my fears run away."]],[3544,["So all this part is missing in the Western languages."]],[3548,["I think that the childhood themes are not there."]],[3554,["We have about Krishna, about Rama,"]],[3557,["when they were children, how they used to walk,"]],[3560,["how they used to talk,"]],[3562,["how they used to put their finger in the mouth."]],[3564,["Every little, little thing"]],[3566,["is described so beautifully about children."]],[3570,["And that is how I think,"]],[3572,["Indians cannot think of killing their children at all."]],[3575,["I mean it's an impossible situation."]],[3579,["Even in Hindi language, in Marathi language,"]],[3582,["we have such beautiful descriptions"]],[3586,["of these incarnations as children."]],[3590,["Then the third thing,"]],[3593,["which is surprising,"]],[3595,["is that all their romance is before the marriage."]],[3599,["After marriage there is no romance left!"]],[3605,["Third thing is that"]],[3607,["there is no romance described after marriage. All before marriage."]],[3614,["It is the other way around in Indian languages:"]],[3619,["all the romance comes when you are married -"]],[3622,["- very sweet, sweet things."]],[3626,["I was surprised - I asked somebody to find out one English book"]],[3630,["where they have described the romance"]],[3634,["of the married couple."]],[3636,["None!"]],[3638,["Finished!"]],[3640,["All the romance is over. Once you are married it is finished."]],[3646,["Then what do you do?"]],[3647,["You quarrel, you fight, you go to the courts, take a divorce."]],[3658,["That description is not there."]],[3663,["And this is the significant thing"]],[3665,["that on us (Indians)"]],[3668,["there is a very big blessing of our Indian culture, very big!"]],[3684,["Please, remove that."]],[3690,["Someone can come and remove it."]],[3705,["So I have read the translation of the Bible in Marathi."]],[3712,["And whatever is written there,"]],[3716,["has great depth."]],[3721,["I feel that English language has changed its essential nature."]],[3726,["And even with regard to Christ,"]],[3728,["His sacred identity and spiritual significance"]],[3733,["has been preserved in the Marathi Bible."]],[3738,["This is not there in the Hindi translation,"]],[3740,["nor is it there in the English version."]],[3745,["The third thing is"]],[3748,["that the Maharashtrians have high self esteem."]],[3752,["In Rajasthan also, the people from Mewar are very self esteemed."]],[3757,["They would not learn anything from the British."]],[3762,["If the English tried to teach them"]],[3763,["they would say, “Leave it. No need."]],[3767,["We have seen many like you”."]],[3772,["But in the North of India I have seen that"]],[3774,["they are greatly impressed by the English."]],[3778,["Wearing good suits,"]],[3779,["wearing ties, boots,"]],[3781,["commanding and ordering others."]],[3784,["It's not so in Maharashtra."]],[3786,["To get a Maharashtrian wear a suit is the most difficult thing!"]],[3797,["They wear dhotis."]],[3800,["Even educated people wear only dhotis."]],[3802,["You can see that Tilak,"]],[3804,["who was such a great leader in the country,"]],[3807,["or we had Ranade (great leader)"]],[3809,["or Agarkar(great leader), all of them -"]],[3811,["no one wore suits and boots."]],[3815,["No one used to wear tie or anything."]],[3818,["Of course, if they are in government jobs, that is a different matter."]],[3822,["But here, even to be employed in a government job"]],[3825,["was considered below ones' dignity and status."]],[3828,["In Maharashtra, you must be knowing,"]],[3830,["that many times it has been written,"]],[3833,["it has been written many times,"]],[3836,["“Why don't you take a government job?”."]],[3840,["And they would mention three-four names of government officials"]],[3844,["as an example that they were doing well."]],[3847,["But there is no honor and glory in a government job."]],[3850,["Not at all!"]],[3853,["My father used to say"]],[3856,["that working for someone was inferior."]],[3861,["Better to have your own profession."]],[3864,["And a government job is the lowest form of employment."]],[3871,["It destroys a person’s character."]],[3874,["And I've seen this is very true."]],[3879,["Now, if someone gets into the IAS (Indian Administrative Service),"]],[3884,["then finished. His value goes up in the marriage market -"]],[3889,["30 lakhs, 35 lakhs."]],[3895,["An IAS Officer in North India is considered a big man."]],[3899,["Here it's not so."]],[3901,["But here, if a man is educated, if he is a scholar,"]],[3906,["then he is appreciated;"]],[3908,["and most of all if he is spiritually sound."]],[3911,["This is a very great difference."]],[3914,["And that is why in the early days in Delhi,"]],[3917,["I used to wonder what will these people understand?"]],[3921,["But it is most amazing,"]],[3925,["that in Delhi,"]],[3927,["Sahaja Yoga has spread so wide; in Lucknow also."]],[3931,["I just cannot believe!"]],[3937,["With whose blessings has it happened?"]],[3940,["These people were so badly servile to the British."]],[3944,["What has happened to them now?"]],[3949,["How did they get transformed?"]],[3952,["I feel that where Shri Rama and Shri Krishna,"]],[3958,["made their divine abodes,"]],[3962,["there reside their blessings."]],[3965,["There is no other explanation."]],[3967,["Especially Lucknow, which was a place of indulgence"]],[3970,["– eat, drink and have fun -"]],[3973,["they were all indulgent and carefree..."]],[3977,["I always hesitated as I did not know what to talk to such people."]],[3980,["All their relationships, discussions, I just couldn’t understand."]],[3985,["I was coming from Maharashtra and just couldn't understand their way of life."]],[3989,["Making fun of daughter-in-law or making fun of sister-in-law,"]],[3993,["it never made sense to me!"]],[3998,["And now I perceive there"]],[4000,["the blessings of Shri Rama and Shri Krishna,"]],[4006,["the poetry of Kabir,"]],[4009,["the blessings of Nanak Sahib."]],[4011,["Oh! These people of Punjab -"]],[4013,["I studied in Punjab,"]],[4014,["and I felt that in the brains of these people of Punjab,"]],[4018,["Sahaja Yoga will never enter!"]],[4021,["And now I was amazed!"]],[4024,["I am very amazed!"]],[4026,["So much bhakti"]],[4028,["and so much bliss and joy."]],[4031,["How did they attain this?"]],[4035,["There were no big public programs there,"]],[4038,["nor did anyone give big lectures."]],[4042,["How did all this happen?"]],[4044,["Now in Maharashtra I really worked hard"]],[4049,["Oh my God! So many villages and hamlets"]],[4052,["I visited and worked very hard."]],[4056,["But in Maharashtra it did not spread so much."]],[4060,["The quality I found in North India"]],[4063,["it is not in Maharashtra."]],[4067,["It is really surprising."]],[4069,["I thought, all My efforts in Maharashtra will go in vain."]],[4073,["On the contrary they got after Me!"]],[4077,["So, I discovered one thing,"]],[4081,["that there are a lot of false gurus there!"]],[4085,["So many gurus! Everyone has a personal guru;"]],[4089,["each home has a guru;"]],[4091,["It was overrun with gurus!"]],[4093,["Even in the Panchaang (astrological calendar)"]],[4095,["even there, every guru’s name,"]],[4098,["date of birth, place etc. is recorded! Oh My God -"]],[4100,["all completely useless people."]],[4107,["Of course there were a few genuine gurus also"]],[4109,["but very few."]],[4111,["Very few."]],[4113,["The others, such useless gurus,"]],[4116,["are either interested in money"]],[4118,["or interested in women!"]],[4122,["This large land of Maharashtra, such a sacred land,"]],[4126,["has been"]],[4129,["blessed by the different aspects of the Devi"]],[4132,["Mahalakshmi, Mahasaraswati, Mahakali"]],[4136,["and Adi Shakti -"]],[4137,["all of them have place in this Mahashtra."]],[4140,["And the eight Vinayakas and Mahavinayaka,"]],[4143,["are all sitting here."]],[4145,["One thing is that these people are not immoral,"]],[4147,["they have no dirty thoughts,"]],[4148,["but they have no capability"]],[4154,["to understand what is dharma,"]],[4157,["They don't have the capacity."]],[4160,["They only know"]],[4163,["going to the temples, ringing the bells"]],[4167,["and running after gurus for salvation."]],[4170,["They are too much ritualistic people."]],[4175,["There is no other problem of immorality with them."]],[4178,["But they are so steeped in ritualism"]],[4180,["that they are not able to come out of all these habits."]],[4183,["I have given you the analysis of the situation, this way."]],[4188,["The foreigners"]],[4192,["from whom I had no expectations whatsoever -"]],[4195,["I used to feel what kind of people are these,"]],[4198,["they have no understanding of anything -"]],[4202,["and they have reached such heights."]],[4204,["And the people of the North whom I never thought"]],[4207,["that they would come to Sahaja Yoga..."]],[4210,["I used to call Dilli(Delhi) as Billi(cat)."]],[4215,["My marriage took place in Delhi."]],[4218,["My father also lived in Delhi."]],[4221,["I had no hopes from North India."]],[4223,["But, it is a very surprizing thing"]],[4226,["that today in Delhi"]],[4228,["and further North of Delhi,"]],[4231,["in Punjab,  in  U.P., all over,"]],[4235,["in Rajasthan,"]],[4237,["Sahaja Yoga has spread."]],[4241,["But Maharashtra it is a misfortune."]],[4244,["And because of it,"]],[4247,["your coming here is very important."]],[4250,["Because of your chaitanya,"]],[4252,["a lot of awakening can take place here"]],[4256,["and people can feel it."]],[4259,["By your coming here, your attention also comes to this place,"]],[4263,["and by that, in Mahashtra"]],[4266,["all the false gurus settled here - there are lots of them still..."]],[4270,["In Maharashtra there is a saying “Ucchal Bangdi Karle”."]],[4274,["I cannot tell you the translation of this."]],[4280,["The job of picking and throwing them out"]],[4282,["can be achieved only through your Chaitanya."]],[4285,["Especially today, when"]],[4291,["you are worshiping the pure personality of Christ,"]],[4297,["His purest life,"]],[4301,["you are offering respect to Him,"]],[4304,["I would definitely say that,"]],[4307,["that all these"]],[4309,["so many false gurus settled here -"]],[4313,["which Christ, if He was here, He would have whipped them with a hunter -"]],[4318,["all such false gurus"]],[4324,["would be compelled to pick up their wares and run away!"]],[4330,["And after running away, I don't know where they will go."]],[4335,["They have made a lot of money,"]],[4337,["and befooled many people."]],[4338,["But there is also a kind of narrow-mindedness,"]],[4343,["a kind of foolishness in people here."]],[4350,["Any guru comes they will prostate at his feet."]],[4354,["There are a lot of \"feet touching\" devotees here!"]],[4359,["So this is one thing inside us:"]],[4364,["the capacity to get befouled!"]],[4367,["I don't know from where it has come."]],[4371,["Whoever comes and teaches anything,"]],[4373,["its our heritage: \"Gurudev has come!\"."]],[4385,["It is due to this blind following"]],[4388,["that the spiritual culture of Maharashtra has been destroyed."]],[4391,["And I would say that,"]],[4393,["today when you are worshipping the life of Christ,"]],[4396,["His simplicity,"]],[4398,["His purity,"]],[4400,["the weapon of His innocence,"]],[4405,["the power of Shri Ganesha,"]],[4407,["will definitely destroy these people,"]],[4410,["and in Maharashtra the spiritual awakening will take place as well."]],[4414,["Here also the people will achieve"]],[4416,["that spiritual treasure and Param Tattwa (Divine essence)"]],[4421,["which existed in so many saints here."]],[4426,["There was no saint who did not mention about Kundalini."]],[4430,["All the saints here talked about Kundalini."]],[4435,["Saints, one greater than the other lived in this land."]],[4442,["I think about those saints in this country,"]],[4446,["who have worked so hard here,"]],[4451,["and tried to awaken spirituality."]],[4454,["Here, even I could not succeed."]],[4458,["But I congratulate you for coming here."]],[4462,["Your coming here will definitely put sense into these people."]],[4468,["They will realise that"]],[4469,["they are just running after false gurus."]],[4473,["I am telling you all this"]],[4478,["because many people suggested that, \"Mother,"]],[4481,["instead of Ganapatiphule,"]],[4483,["You should have your program in our place\"."]],[4488,["But I said “No! You come here!\""]],[4491,["Because it is your duty"]],[4495,["that you bring about awakening within everybody."]],[4499,["Spiritual awakening in Maharashtra is imperative."]],[4503,["So it is necesary for you to come here."]],[4507,["And that too, here (Ganapatipule) -"]],[4510,["the place of Shri Jesus Christ - we honor it by our coming."]],[4515,["He is very important here."]],[4519,["I tell you., He will take the whip to whip all these false gurus"]],[4524,["and finish them off."]],[4527,["But you must know"]],[4531,["that today we are here to worship and awaken"]],[4537,["His supreme divinity."]],[4539,["And with His power,"]],[4542,["Maharashtra will become purified and holy."]],[4546,["They do a lot of worshipping of Ganesha,"]],[4550,["they worship Ganesha a lot."]],[4552,["But who is Shri Ganesha,"]],[4554,["what does He stand for - all this they do not know."]],[4560,["I don’t understand this."]],[4562,["They are so entangled in this mess;"]],[4564,["and to release them it is necessary for you to come here."]],[4568,["To come every year,"]],[4570,["and worship and celebrate the birthday of Christ"]],[4575,["is a great undertaking."]],[4581,["My unending blessings to all of you."]]]);
